---
// Perfect Forward Secrecy (PFS) and Post-Compromise Security (PCS) Timeline Diagram Component
---

<figure class="pfs-diag" aria-labelledby="pfs-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="pfs-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 240"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="pfs-diag-title pfs-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="pfs-diag-title">
      前向保密性（PFS）與後向安全性（PCS）時序定義圖
    </title>
    <desc id="pfs-diag-desc">
      展示設備私鑰洩漏時，PFS 保證過去歷史訊息依然安全，PCS
      透過密鑰自癒保證未來訊息重新安全。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="pfs-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="pfs-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="210"
      rx="12"
      class="pfs-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- 3 Epoch Boxes -->
    <!-- Epoch 1: Past / PFS (x: 45, width: 245) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 30)">
      <rect
        width="245"
        height="70"
        rx="8"
        class="pfs-diag__box pfs-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="122"
        y="28"
        class="pfs-diag__title pfs-diag__title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        歷史過去訊息 (Past)
      </text>
      <rect
        x="15"
        y="38"
        width="215"
        height="22"
        rx="4"
        class="pfs-diag__pill pfs-diag__pill--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="122"
        y="53"
        class="pfs-diag__pill-text pfs-diag__pill-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        PFS: 密鑰已銷毀，歷史密文不可破！
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Epoch 2: Compromise (x: 315, width: 250) -->
    <g transform="translate(315, 30)">
      <rect
        width="250"
        height="70"
        rx="8"
        class="pfs-diag__box pfs-diag__box--red"></rect>
      <text
        x="125"
        y="28"
        class="pfs-diag__title pfs-diag__title--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ⚠️ 設備私鑰洩漏 / 短暫被攻破
      </text>
      <rect
        x="15"
        y="38"
        width="220"
        height="22"
        rx="4"
        class="pfs-diag__pill pfs-diag__pill--red"></rect>
      <text
        x="125"
        y="53"
        class="pfs-diag__pill-text pfs-diag__pill-text--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        攻擊者獲取某時刻暫態密鑰 (Snapshot)
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Epoch 3: Future / PCS (x: 590, width: 245) -->
    <g transform="translate(590, 30)">
      <rect
        width="245"
        height="70"
        rx="8"
        class="pfs-diag__box pfs-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="122"
        y="28"
        class="pfs-diag__title pfs-diag__title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        未來通訊訊息 (Future)
      </text>
      <rect
        x="15"
        y="38"
        width="215"
        height="22"
        rx="4"
        class="pfs-diag__pill pfs-diag__pill--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="122"
        y="53"
        class="pfs-diag__pill-text pfs-diag__pill-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        PCS: 協議自動注入新熵，自癒加密！
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Timeline Arrow Axis -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 125)">
      <line
        x1="0"
        y1="0"
        x2="780"
        y2="0"
        class="pfs-diag__axis-line"
        marker-end="url(#pfs-arrow-blue)"></line>
      <circle cx="122" cy="0" r="5" class="pfs-diag__dot pfs-diag__dot--green"
      ></circle>
      <circle cx="395" cy="0" r="6" class="pfs-diag__dot pfs-diag__dot--red"
      ></circle>
      <circle cx="667" cy="0" r="5" class="pfs-diag__dot pfs-diag__dot--green"
      ></circle>
      <text x="790" y="4" class="pfs-diag__axis-label" text-anchor="end"
        >通訊時間軸 (Timeline) ➔</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Summary Banner at Bottom -->
    <g transform="translate(140, 160)">
      <rect width="600" height="42" rx="8" class="pfs-diag__summary-box"></rect>
      <text x="300" y="26" class="pfs-diag__summary-text" text-anchor="middle">
        🛡️ 真 E2EE 的密碼學黃金標準：過去密文不可破（PFS） ＋
        未來通訊自動自癒（PCS）
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="pfs-diag__mobile">
    <div class="pfs-mobile-card pfs-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="pfs-mobile-badge pfs-mobile-badge--green"
        >PAST: PFS 保證</span
      >
      <h4>1. 歷史過去訊息（前向保密 Perfect Forward Secrecy）</h4>
      <p>
        每條訊息的暫態密鑰在加解密完成後立即從記憶體徹底抹除。即使攻擊者今日拿到設備的長期私鑰，也完全無法回溯解密過去攔截的歷史密文！
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pfs-mobile-card pfs-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="pfs-mobile-badge pfs-mobile-badge--red">EVENT: 私鑰遭竊</span
      >
      <h4>2. 設備遭惡意滲透 / 短暫淪陷</h4>
      <p>
        攻擊者獲取用戶當前暫態密鑰快照。若無安全機制，攻擊者將持續偷聽所有後續對話。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pfs-mobile-card pfs-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="pfs-mobile-badge pfs-mobile-badge--green"
        >FUTURE: PCS 自癒</span
      >
      <h4>3. 未來通訊訊息（後向安全 Post-Compromise Security）</h4>
      <p>
        用戶只要持續發送新訊息，雙棘輪協議會觸發新的 DH
        非對稱密鑰交換，注入全新隨機熵，協議在數輪對話內自動自癒並將攻擊者徹底踢出！
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="pfs-diag-caption" class="pfs-diag__caption">
    圖一：端到端加密核心安全性質：前向保密性（PFS）與後向安全性（PCS）時序定義
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .pfs-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .pfs-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .pfs-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .pfs-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .pfs-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .pfs-diag__box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .pfs-diag__box--green {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1b2e23);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .pfs-diag__box--red {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #2d1d24);
    stroke: #da3633;
  }

  .pfs-diag__title {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pfs-diag__title--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .pfs-diag__title--red {
    fill: #f85149;
  }

  .pfs-diag__pill {
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .pfs-diag__pill--green {
    fill: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .pfs-diag__pill--red {
    fill: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.2);
    stroke: #da3633;
  }

  .pfs-diag__pill-text {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pfs-diag__pill-text--green {
    fill: #56d364;
  }

  .pfs-diag__pill-text--red {
    fill: #f85149;
  }

  .pfs-diag__axis-line {
    stroke: #58a6ff;
    stroke-width: 2.5px;
  }

  .pfs-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .pfs-diag__dot {
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .pfs-diag__dot--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
    stroke: #ffffff;
  }

  .pfs-diag__dot--red {
    fill: #f85149;
    stroke: #ffffff;
  }

  .pfs-diag__axis-label {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .pfs-diag__summary-box {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #10141a);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .pfs-diag__summary-text {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__box--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__box--red {
    fill: #ffebe9;
    stroke: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__title--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__title--red {
    fill: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__pill--green {
    fill: #dcfce7;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__pill--red {
    fill: #ffebe9;
    stroke: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__pill-text--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__pill-text--red {
    fill: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__axis-line {
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__axis-label {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__summary-box {
    fill: #f6f8fa;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .pfs-diag__summary-text {
    fill: var(--dg-ink, #24292f);
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .pfs-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .pfs-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .pfs-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
      background: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    }

    .pfs-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .pfs-mobile-card--red {
      border-color: #da3633;
      background: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.05);
    }

    .pfs-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .pfs-mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .pfs-mobile-badge--red {
      background: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.2);
      color: #f85149;
    }

    .pfs-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .pfs-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
    }
  }
</style>
